  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372160/description_e1c1cc00-351f-4f50-a009-c1dd95750920.png\" alt=\"Goety Event Horizon\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"><br><strong>Goety Event Horizon</strong>（前身為 Goety End Biomes）是一款旨在擴展 <strong>Goety</strong> 終界更新的模組，透過為終界加入受 <strong>《我的世界：地下城》</strong> 啟發的全新生物群系與敵人來豐富遊戲內容。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>探索外層終界島嶼，發現 2 個全新生物群系！<br><br><strong>合唱森林<br><br></strong><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372160/description_de519a96-2161-48a3-add1-7bda2b4407df.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>終界荒野<br><br></strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372160/description_c90de687-a908-4511-86c2-1ea1805737d7.png\"><br></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>避開或擊敗野生的終界靈！<br><br></strong><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372160/description_af846bd4-19ff-4e1d-b50b-87ec94bc68bb.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>本模組需要 <strong>Goety</strong>&nbsp;與 <strong>Blueprint API</strong>。<br><br><strong>製作人員</strong>：<br><br><strong>boxknight</strong> - 協助建立部分功能的結構<br><strong>Polarice3</strong> - 原始模組與 <strong>Goety</strong> 的作者<br><strong>Mojang</strong> - <strong>《我的世界：地下城》</strong> 的開發者</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/7R4drtP6Sc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372160/description_3a9c063d-1f5f-4c07-9d50-5fad214c95b6.png\" width=\"54\" height=\"54\"></a></p>",
